%% AD-02 Scholarship application lifecycle (student and administrator lanes)
flowchart TD
    classDef startend fill:#0b5d3b,stroke:#083f28,color:#fff,font-weight:bold
    classDef proc fill:#f4f7f5,stroke:#0b5d3b,color:#1f2937
    classDef dec fill:#fff8e6,stroke:#c9a227,color:#1f2937
    classDef admin fill:#eaf1fb,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#1f2937
    classDef term fill:#fdeaea,stroke:#b91c1c,color:#1f2937

    A([Student browses open scholarships]):::startend --> B[Open scholarship detail]:::proc
    B --> C{Eligible?}:::dec
    C -- No --> C1[Show failing criteria and reasons]:::proc
    C1 --> A
    C -- Yes --> D{Existing application?}:::dec
    D -- Yes --> D1[Open existing application]:::proc
    D -- No --> E[Create draft + generate SCH-YYYY-NNNNNN]:::proc
    E --> F[Upload required documents while draft]:::proc
    F --> G{All required documents uploaded?}:::dec
    G -- No --> F
    G -- Yes --> H[Submit application]:::proc
    H --> I[Status submitted, history recorded, student notified]:::proc

    I --> J[Admin opens review queue]:::admin
    J --> K[Move to under_review]:::admin
    K --> L{Decision?}:::dec
    L -- Verify documents --> M[Status document_verification]:::admin
    M --> N[Verify or reject each document]:::admin
    N --> O{Every required document verified?}:::dec
    O -- No --> N
    O -- Yes --> P{Admin approves?}:::dec
    P -- Approve --> Q[Status approved, student notified]:::proc
    P -- Reject --> R[Status rejected with remarks, student notified]:::proc
    L -- Reject --> R

    Q --> S([Terminal]):::startend
    R --> S
    S --> T[No reapplication permitted — unique index]:::term
